                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1dcae990-8637-38b7-aaf1-a6bd55b5a947",
                        "entry_id": "5739c51e-4b30-3be9-a59a-c0acbcca5db9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Appareil qui est utilisé aussi bien dans les ateliers et sur les chantiers pour lever ou déplacer de grosses charges, décintrer des poutres ou pièces métalliques, supporter des charges […] que, dans un automatisme, pour assurer des fonctions d’ouverture/fermeture, de blocage, de rotation […]. Suivant les modèles, il peut-être constitué d’une simple tige filetée ou, le plus souvent d’une tige, dans un tube, le corps, et déplacée par la pression d’un fluide pneumatique ou hydraulique, ou enfin, mu par un moteur ou une tension électrique."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7fd3bf87-b8f0-4889-bdfe-997e370020be",
                                "sense_id": "1dcae990-8637-38b7-aaf1-a6bd55b5a947",
                                "text": "Posée sur douze vérins en appui sur la structure de la tour, la plate-forme de déconstruction permet à des engins de petite taille pourvus de pince de grignotage d'intervenir, avec un faible impact environnemental."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "037efa4a-42c3-4ba2-87ec-c739dae7f3f3",
                        "source_entry_id": "5739c51e-4b30-3be9-a59a-c0acbcca5db9",
                        "source_sense_id": "1dcae990-8637-38b7-aaf1-a6bd55b5a947",
                        "target_lang_word": "cylinder",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cylinder",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ec4ddc65-6366-34ad-8846-36eeb1acd4b5",
                                        "entry_id": "7f37643a-829b-30f0-81ec-cdd262e8076e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A surface created by projecting a closed two-dimensional curve along an axis intersecting the plane of the curve."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b807429f-0c28-4148-8ffa-806333103129",
                                                "sense_id": "ec4ddc65-6366-34ad-8846-36eeb1acd4b5",
                                                "text": "When the two-dimensional curve is a circle, the cylinder is called a circular cylinder. When the axis is perpendicular to the plane of the curve, the cylinder is called a right cylinder. In non-mathematical usage, both right and circular are usually implied."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "680acd26-fff0-31a8-bcdb-8d35e3b1fca9",
                                        "entry_id": "7f37643a-829b-30f0-81ec-cdd262e8076e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A solid figure bounded by a cylinder and two parallel planes intersecting the cylinder."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1da7fb00-c5e6-32bf-8edd-1623aade683d",
                                        "entry_id": "7f37643a-829b-30f0-81ec-cdd262e8076e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any object in the form of a circular cylinder."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6536a2f7-c7bd-4a8c-a876-e17e772c9ec9",
                                                "sense_id": "1da7fb00-c5e6-32bf-8edd-1623aade683d",
                                                "text": "A big greyish rounded bulk, the size, perhaps, of a bear, was rising slowly and painfully out of the cylinder."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "545dff80-cd23-392b-8f8f-d1d97440188b",
                                        "entry_id": "7f37643a-829b-30f0-81ec-cdd262e8076e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cylindrical cavity or chamber in a mechanism, such as the counterpart to a piston found in a piston-driven engine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9cd64f2b-4ed7-39b8-961e-3b1aba372851",
                                        "entry_id": "7f37643a-829b-30f0-81ec-cdd262e8076e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The space in which a piston travels inside a reciprocating engine or pump."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fef6485f-0d93-3ed4-b9ba-e8fb9f074782",
                                        "entry_id": "7f37643a-829b-30f0-81ec-cdd262e8076e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A container in the form of a cylinder with rounded ends for storing pressurized gas; a gas cylinder."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f02ecadb-ae08-3d4d-bcd6-d7e928693765",
                                        "entry_id": "7f37643a-829b-30f0-81ec-cdd262e8076e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An early form of phonograph recording, made on a wax cylinder."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d088b460-86d0-3660-9d28-448a4c1d7ad3",
                                        "entry_id": "7f37643a-829b-30f0-81ec-cdd262e8076e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The part of a revolver that contains chambers for the cartridges."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "33491847-9585-33d9-9c7a-936d5180c434",
